    "text": "begin with the original source rather than the bank feed. a customer invoice, sales report, payroll register, supplier bill, or contract explains what occurred. match it to the corresponding deposit or payment, investigate differences, and record adjustments with a clear explanation. when a state tax or payroll report is required, maintain a separate reconciliation from the ledger to the amounts included in that report. that allows an owner to compare operating results without confusing business income with taxes collected, employee withholdings, or other liabilities."
